    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2106_05609_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "if | S Our GAS framework utilizes historical embeddings as an affordable approximation. The idea of historical embeddings was originally introduced in VR-GCN ( Chen et al. , 2018b ). VR-GCN aims to reduce the variance in estimation during neighbor sampling ( Hamilton et al. , 2017 ), and avoids the need to sample a large amount of neighbors in return. Cong et al. ( 2020 ) further simplied this scheme into a one-shot sampling scenario, where nodes no longer need to recursively explore neighborhoo" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2106_05609_rag__chunk_011> a kg:Chunk ;
