    kg:textSpan "challenging due to the limited amount of memory available on a single GPU or a single machine. As such, mini-batch training is used to train GNN models on such giant graphs. However, due to the connectivities between nodes, computing the embeddings of a node with multi-layer GNNs usually involves in many nodes in a mini-batch. This leads to substantial computation and data movement between CPUs and GPUs in mini-batch training and makes training inefficient. To remedy this issue, various GNN trai" .

