    kg:textSpan "heuristics as well as preserving the connectivity. Assignment: The block assigner collects the blocks of the multi-level coarsened graph from block generators for partitioning. It applies a greedy assignment heuristics to form graph partitions, targeting both multi-hop locality and training node balancing. The block assigner then broadcasts the block partitions to the generators. We leave the details of the assignment heuristics in 3.3.2 . Figure 9: The partition workow of our partition algorith" .

