    kg:textSpan "leads to on-average 2.29 speedup over AWB-GCN [13], while sparsification further provides 1.09 speedups. Meanwhile, the GCoD (8-bit) variant offers an additional 2.02 on-average speedup. Figure 10: The normalized inference speedups (w.r.t. PyGCPU) comparisons on large GCN models and graph datasets. [TABLE id=2112.11594_p11_tV] caption: Table V: System configurations of the baselines and GCoD. columns: col1 row: col1=Speedups (x) Speedups (x) [/TABLE] 4096 PEs 9MB BRAM 33MB URAM GCoD 330MHz@ VCU1" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2112_11594_rag__chunk_024> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "2112.11594_rag::chunk_024" ;
