    kg:textSpan "that of the input features. Based on this assumption, 3 leverages inter-layer model parallelism for the first layer (i.e., distributedly computing ( 1 ) by splitting along the column dimension) to distribute the burdensome storage of input features and then uses data parallelism (i.e., distributively storing for computing node embeddings) for reducing the required communications for transferring intermediate embeddings. Additionally, 3 further pipelines communication and computation across mini-" .

