    kg:textSpan "workload size is dominated by the number of node neighbors ( e.g. , large node degree), we may customize the design that could concurrently process more neighbors to increase the computing parallelism among neighbors. On the other hand, if the workload size is dominated by node embedding size ( e.g. , high-dimensional node embedding), we may consider boosting the computing parallelism along the node embedding dimension. Note that the node degree and embedding dimension information can be extract" .

