    kg:textSpan "embeddings is expensive. Currently, most existing systems utilized a centralized architecture. For example, NeuGraph [ 27 ] proposes the GNN training framework on a multi-GPU single machine with METIS [ 18 ] partitioning and specialized optimization in scheduling and pipelining. However, it is not released for public access. RoC [ 16 ] dynamically partitions the graph with an online regression method and proposes a sophisticated memory management method among workers, at the cost of complex work" .

