    kg:textSpan "not seem to have the expressiveness required to implement GNNs. By contrast, our distributed algorithms can be used to implement anything that is supported by PyTorch Geometric, which already implements a vast majority of top GNN models in the literature. On the other hand, DGL is an active large-scale project that provides a convenient graph-based interface instead of exposing sparse matrices to the user, and it automatically fuses operations to avoid unnecessary data movement and computation. " .

