    kg:textSpan "the CPU to prefetch a super-batch (SBG) of essential data from SSDs to CPU memory, thereby minimizing subsequent SSD accesses when generating mini-batch data (MBG) from the corresponding super-batch. Specifically, Ginex adopts an inspector-executor model in each GNN training epoch. During the inspector stage, Ginex uses the CPU to process a super-batch including sampled vertices of all corresponding mini-batches, and execute feature cache management including loading features from disk to CPU me" .

