    kg:textSpan "LeapGNN: Accelerating Distributed GNN Training Leveraging Feature-Centric Model Migration Weijian Chen, Shuibing He, and Haoyang Qu, Zhejiang University; Xuechen Zhang, Washington State University Vancouver https://www.usenix.org/conference/fast25/presentation/chen-weijian-leap This paper is included in the Proceedings of the 23rd USENIX Conference on File and Storage Technologies. February 2527, 2025 Santa Clara, CA, USA Open access to the Proceedings of the 23rd USENIX Conference on File and S" .

