    kg:docId "isca22_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/isca22_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "vertex is the same in both datasets. Therefore, the ratio between the accesses in the aggregation and in the update is lower in wikipedia than in products . 7.3.2 Overall Memory System Performance. The use of the DMA engine improves the memory system performance. Specifically, we measure that the L2 miss rate decreases from 20.5% to 2.8% in products and from 45.5% to 2.8% in wikipedia . Moreover, the processor stall time due to waiting for the memory system decreases from 58.1% to 42.8% in produ" .

