    kg:textSpan "exploits the parallelisms unique to GNN to maximize hardware utilization, thereby improving execution efciency. The architecture is also applicable to a broad domain of GNNs. We evaluate Z IPPER with detailed experiments and demonstrate average 93 . 6 and 1 . 56 speedup with 147 and 4 . 85 energy reduction over CPU and GPU, respectively. Out-edge Out-edge ELW GOP GEMM Tensor ScatterScatterSumDst SumDst GatherGatherReLU ReLU V F V F V F V F V F V F FC FC (a) LeakyReLU Out-edge ScatterIn-edge SumD" .

