    kg:textSpan "is the pioneering work to reduce node receptive field with node-wise sampling. For each layer , GraphSAGE uniformly samples a fixed number ( ( ) ) of neighboring nodes for each node. In other words, each neighbor node in N ( ) has an equal probability 1 / ( ) to be 12 Zhang, Shichang, et al. Node-wise Layer-wise Subgraph-wise E E E Selected input nodes in the current batch F H F H F H A B C Sampled A B C A B C Nodes sampled in the 1st GNN layer Graph G G G D D D Nodes sampled in the 2nd GNN laye" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2306_14052_rag__chunk_036> a kg:Chunk ;
