        "GNNAdvisor: An Adaptive and Efficient Runtime System for GNN Acceleration on GPUs"^^xsd:string,
        "GNNIE: GNN Inference Engine with Load-balancing and Graph-Specic Caching"^^xsd:string,
        "The current design of GNN systems such as DGL"^^xsd:string,
        "The current design of GNN systems such as DGL, balance computation across multiple GPUs"^^xsd:string,
        "large-scale parallel and distributed computing becomes imperative for handling GNNs effectively"^^xsd:string,
        "partitioning the input graph and distributing it to multiple workers to train the same GNN model collaboratively."^^xsd:string,
        "the authors summarize the current GNN systems into two categories"^^xsd:string,
