    kg:textSpan "dense parameters. Some GNN models may additionally learn an embedding for each vertex. Embeddings are part of the model parameters and only a subset of vertex embeddings are updated in a mini-batch. We refer to these model parameters as sparse parameters. B. Mini-batch training GNN models on a large dataset can be trained in a minibatch fashion just like deep neural networks in other domains like computer vision and natural language processing. However, GNN mini-batch training is different from " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2106_06150_rag__chunk_006> a kg:Chunk ;
