    kg:textSpan "GOP in Section 2) dominates an algorithm at a given moment in time. GNNs exhibit a much more diverse mix of primitive operations than traditional graph processing and CNNs. GOP dominates the execution of PageRank , while GEMM and ELW dominate the execution of VGG . In contrast, all the three primitives operations exist in GNNs; the interleaving of the three operations varies by GNN model. It is worth noting that prior GNN accelerators [ 15 , 22 , 24 , 37 , 41 ] target only one particular type of" .

